      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-08-19_WidnesExaminer_art0014" n="art0014">
        <head>LIVERPOOL, ST. HELENS, AND SOUTH ' LANCASHIRE RAILWAY.</head>
        <p>LIVERPOOL, ST. HELENS, AND SOUTH ' LANCASHIRE RAILWAY.</p>
        <p>HALF-YEARLY REPORT;</p>
        <p>The half-yearly report of the now Liverpool, St. Helens, and soutla Lancashire Railway Company has just been issued, and shows that the total capital authorised is £133.000, nut of which £280,000 has been created or sanctioned, leaving a balance of £453,000 The amount expendea up to December, 1892' was £190,400 13. 7,1., and during the past six months £28,243 134.9 1., making a total of £218,643 153. 4d. The six months' expendi- ture had been made up as Follows :—Land purchase and compensation. £2.059 143 41. ; construction of way and stations, £25.253 0. id. ; law and Parliamentary charges, £784 43. 7d.; general expenses, £146 14,. 91. It is estimated that during the half-year to December 31st, 1893, £45,000 will be expended for lands, works. engineering, law, and general charges, and in anbseqn- ent half-years, £465,000, giving a total of £510.000. The capital powers and other assets available to meet the further expenditure are given as follows :—Loan capital authorised but not created or sanctioned, £183,000; sharp capital anthorised but not created or sanctioned. £270.000; share capital crated but not issued, £61,810 ; share capital issued but not received.. £2B4—total, £515,094; less ca:o;ital account balance, at debit, £737 153. 41. The mileage state cent shows that there are nineteen miles authorised, eight and a half miles of which are in course of construction. The direc- tors report that satisfactory progress has been made with the works during the past six months. Three difficult pieces of construction in crossing the canals belonging to the London and North-Western. Railway Cf.mpany are on the point of completion, and when finished the em- bankment into St. Helens can be rapidly proceeded with. The station-yard at Golbrzne is practically ready for opening, and that at Ashton.in-Makerfial is well in hand.</p>
