      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-08-19_WidnesExaminer_art0087" n="art0087">
        <head>GOOD ADVICE.</head>
        <p>GOOD ADVICE.</p>
        <p>FOR PURE DRlfli:.-.1:1-11E72-111iMf-CA—L-S. FIRST CLASS DISPENSNG. WWI.; SUE PERFUMES, PATENT MEDICINES A T CST PRICES; GOOD AND CHEAP ::PONGES go to SANK EY-ST. pll AR NI A CY. • 63, SANKEY-ST. (Opposite Legh-st.) WARRINGTON. PROPRICroIt : HENRY M. ASH TON, A.P.S. Chemist by</p>
