        <p>- - - - " TH' OWD LAD'S CUM BACK!" Sing,Nyowton, one an' aw sing eawt, Let ey'ry beggar on yo sheaut, An' let sum music rowl abeaut— Th' Owd Lad's cum back 1 Eaur station looks moor like itsel', Ez needs no diver 'en to tell— A w's gooin' like a marriage bell— Th' Owd Lad's cum back! Thoose porters—good ns ey'ry one— Keep smiling at ther " Grand Owd Mon," Fer aw ther werrit in' ez gone— Owd Lad's cum back! Yon lonlert, deawn at foote o'th broo, Fz bin a fortnit in a stew, But neaw htz ta'n another cue— Th' Owd Lad's cum back? The very Pepper Men are fain, An' keep on singin' this strain-- "By Gyow, we're glad yo're back again !" Th' Owd Lad's cum back ! Wile, ez fer me, aw'm just tip-top, ' ginert's in a lively tlop— Th' reet mon ez gotten Ith reet shop ! Th' Owl Lad's cum back! TUM 0' PEGS. • Rose Bonk, 18, 8, 93.</p>
